Subject: [PATCH] Raise an error if a REGEXP pattern ends with "\\".
 [bugs:/info/2026-10-20T13:44:52Z|Bug 2026-10-20T13:44:52Z]

[Hades: backport to 3.54.1 from branch-3.54. The release is the amalgamation, so the change is made where ext/misc/regexp.c in shell.c. Not carried: test/regexp2.test (tests of the source tree).]

FossilOrigin-Name: 480d6e1a39a2057685260cf8386a3dbef4f391c6d1766a6cded5f8cc4d1a0ec4
Upstream: https://sqlite.org/src/info/480d6e1a39a2057685260cf8386a3dbef4f391c6d1766a6cded5f8cc4d1a0ec4
